    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Havoc-wagers known to delight in chaos, goblins are smaller humanoids of a typically green, yellow, grey, or bluish skin color. This instinctual delight for chaos often puts them at-odds with the codes and laws of other societies, but goblin ingenuity can be an indispensable asset.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Darksight:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> You are not Blinded by Dark.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Nimble:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> You have a 5’ bonus to Speed and ignore Hinder on Reflex Saves.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Scavenger:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> You have Favor on Endure Saves against being Sickened.</span></p>",
